00:11:14.315 --> 00:11:17.800
So it's just a matter where you may
have had some exposure to those concepts

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:21.229
in different places, whether it be
in the classroom, through tests, or

00:11:21.229 --> 00:11:22.415
