00:11:27.321 --> 00:11:31.588
we do go there as a first place to start
to get a sense of what quantitative

00:11:31.588 --> 00:11:33.385
exposure you've had so far.

00:11:33.385 --> 00:11:37.747
&gt;&gt; And I would just add to bring us
