they had really high grades, but

00:11:50.783 --> 00:11:54.606
they didn't necessarily have
intellectual curiosity.

00:11:54.606 --> 00:12:00.444
And I think the opposite is true,
we may see somebody with lower scores,

00:12:00.444 --> 00:12:07.352
but maybe they did original research as
an undergraduate, which is pretty amazing.

00:12:07.352 --> 00:12:08.787
Or maybe at work,

00:12:08.787 --> 00:12:14.543
they wrote kind of a white paper that
took some research and was beyond.

00:12:14.543 --> 00:12:18.264
So when we talk about
the holistic evaluation,

00:12:18.264 --> 00:12:23.193
we're diving deeper than just
the scores and the numbers, and

00:12:23.193 --> 00:12:27.484
we're looking for
examples of intellectual vitality

