00:12:47.455 --> 00:12:51.609
And I think this would be
a really great place to unpack

00:12:51.609 --> 00:12:54.206
intellectual vitality itself.

00:12:54.206 --> 00:12:55.398
I like to think of it as,

00:12:55.398 --> 00:12:59.286
what's your relationship with knowledge
