might succeed in the class?

00:13:24.595 --> 00:13:29.355
But any other thoughts on IV,
Intellectual Vitality broadly?

00:13:29.355 --> 00:13:34.172
&gt;&gt; I guess another example that comes
to mind in terms of intellectual

00:13:34.172 --> 00:13:38.645
curiosity is you may have been
someone who really sought out,

00:13:38.645 --> 00:13:43.720
