00:13:52.666 --> 00:13:58.434
that you were often taking harder
classes or ranging far from your major.

00:13:58.434 --> 00:14:05.092
And so again, I think for me,
a lot of it is curiosity and

00:14:05.092 --> 00:14:10.055
the kind of energy to
follow that curiosity

00:14:10.055 --> 00:14:14.468
even if sometimes it's difficult.

00:14:14.468 --> 00:14:18.930
&gt;&gt; Yeah, and I would say sometimes it's
not only just about the difficulty level

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:23.339
